  "content": "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/6NJZSxXFPV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-JOIN-3f0f0f?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbobotweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-SUPPORT-3f0f0f?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fs%252f1qZlPl6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fiverr-HIRE ME-3f0f0f?style=for-the-badge&logo=fiverr&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Fiverr\"></a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Some Stuff &ndash; Tools</strong> 是一款視覺更新，以現代、簡潔且富有表現力的 <strong>Stuff &amp; Actions</strong> 風格，全面重新設計了所有原版 Minecraft 工具。</h3>\n<h3>此套件完整保留原版核心玩法 &mdash; 無數值變更，無新增物品。<strong>僅更新材質與模型</strong>，讓熟悉的工具煥然一新，同時忠於其原本用途。<br><br></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h2><strong>您或許也會喜歡我的其他作品 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dust-and-ore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dust &amp; Ore</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dust-and-ore-raw-ore-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong style=\"display:inline !important\">Dust &amp; Ore: Raw Ore Expansion</strong></a></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h2>",
